[{"title":"题紫极宫晋桧","author":"释善珍","text":"老君坛西晋朝柏，拜坛道士头发白。\n卖丹得钱还酒客，肉重欲飞鹤无力。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":18405,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题雅上人手抄唐诗后","author":"释善珍","text":"天孙锦段冰蚕茧，太古盘铭苍颉文。\n三百年来消息绝，无人为酬杜陵坟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":18406,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"祭介石","author":"释善珍","text":"末俗住山，尤贵黄纸。\n造物畀公，共衰病至。\n既病之矣，复遇岁艰。\n当八面风，撑百漏船。\n漫刺衔袖，临斋乞米。\n骄儿索饭，饥嗔饱喜。\n我行四方，阅士如墙。\n小智虚夸，妄夫荒唐。\n宣绍命脉，乾淳气魄。\n天悭地閟，神盍宝惜。\n冷灰粟焰，将晓景星。\n泯灭甚易，佛法替陵。\n同时爱憎，异世悲慨。\n诸君不信，有遗录在。\n我作苦语，模写虚空。\n泪尽血续，夫岂为公。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":18407,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"祭双杉塔","author":"释善珍","text":"甲午之冬，一笑分袂。\n交游累千，名字难记。\n公虽它乡，常在眼底。\n公今隔世，犹见梦寐。\n念昔与公，情同昆弟。\n老离闽山，再饮吴水。\n三十年间，死尽流辈。\n顾瞻浮图，洪木翳翳。\n丛林凋疏，变习日异。\n愿起公死，为砭为剂。\n为师为承，为祥为瑞。\n千载追难，百年满易。\n意长景促，人往物是。\n春寒野阴，感慨歔欷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":18408,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"祭见首座","author":"释善珍","text":"佛法下衰，众魔峥嵘。\n如虎而祴，白昼市行。\n晚交得君，如黄河清。\n君与予谈，洞见底里。\n予建一事，君曰可纪。\n予出一辞，君曰入理。\n狂猘狺狺，嗾之者谁。\n君蹑予足，怒形于辞。\n古有徇义，舍父背师。\n曷不千指，曷不百岁。\n神祐靡专，贵奸寿悖。\n谓天昭昭，天实茫昧。\n君素清苦，简洁自持。\n如政黄牛，标韵过之。\n有德操才，得疾亦奇。\n浮华眼前，道义千古。\n昔有微言，噤不敢吐。\n含哀以告，君必领悟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":18409,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"祭光孝南老","author":"释善珍","text":"我昔游浙，多贤友朋。\n老归故山，耳冷如冰。\n忽闻君来，语作吴馨。\n白而长身，美髯垂膺。\n未几月台，挝鼓腾腾。\n巍然广座，摄衣而升。\n我忝邻居，复为交承。\n君素恢疏，不立户庭。\n舌端骋辞，驱涛卷霆。\n疾谁使之，一瞑不醒。\n七尺桐棺，萧然行幐。\n侑此瓣香，感慨曷胜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":18410,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"祭佛照塔","author":"释善珍","text":"师在乾淳，名塞穹壤。\n据妙喜室，鞭挞龙象。\n诸子迭出，如凤如麟。\n如雷破蛰，何草不春。\n余不肖孙，亦忝备位。\n芜辞匪渎，惟以识愧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":18411,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"祭侃古樵塔","author":"释善珍","text":"嘉定之间，公壮我少。\n意气尽同，岂但同调。\n众誇蝇声，而出蚓窍。\n一唱十和，抚掌称妙。\n公独雄浑，间见奇峭。\n如行空麟，如追风骠。\n拥絮曦檐，炀袍夜燎。\n俄聚忽散，人事难料。\n遥睇吴云，夐绝闽徼。\n每得尺书，恍陪色笑。\n龙钟出岭，只影自吊。\n回思岁月，真过野烧。\n偻指旧游，半堕缥渺。\n叫公不应，一灯谁绍。\n铢香后时，幸毋我诮。\n飞锡何之，山深猿啸。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":18412,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"祭果南涧南叔凯","author":"释善珍","text":"我憩闽北，叔凯枉顾。\n出南涧书，剧谈至暮。\n言昔之夜，得梦怪奇。\n当与藏叟，会阿耨池。\n想耶因耶，一笑眇邈。\n执手告戒，义均骨肉。\n心平行粹，爱南涧翁。\n人百忤之，而无愠容。\n凯病且贫，户满客屦。\n翁常解衣，骚骚治具。\n嘉翁风致，古人所难。\n鄙夫悭啬，拔毫如山。\n吁嗟衰年，失二益友。\n耨池西方，游必俱不。\n昼诗绝吟，永帖罢挥。\n猿哀鹤怨，金环不归。\n吊既后时，奠复不早。\n瓣香忏悔，泪湿春草。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":18413,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"祭崇福肇老","author":"释善珍","text":"兄主两山，无顷刻暇。\n踆踆走俗，类古普化。\n人始不识，睢盱猜讶。\n徐察情真，有朴无诈。\n翕然同声，真本色者。\n未几废宇，耽耽大厦。\n昔瓶无粟，今廪多稼。\n松弯易地，筋力已谢。\n犹命肩舆，日谒百舍。\n车殆马烦，途远将夜。\n一身破甑，万事飘瓦。\n追惟何及，抚事悲吒。\n飞书别我，历举昔话。\n云何良友，天不少借。\n一香永诀，老泪盈把。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":18414,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"祭愚谷","author":"释善珍","text":"前春还闽，道传公病。\n聪明忽痴，医不识證。\n石门迎见，悲喜深省。\n莫年客土，相依为命。\n太白残月，同光共影。\n吾曹恢疏，世路机阱。\n身犹弃遗，奚顾堕甑。\n古琴绝弦，缺铛折柄。\n二子谈禅，时隐几听。\n退士献书，阿婆窥镜。\n鬼笑揶揄，人笑齿冷。\n少日与公，讲明素定。\n丹心如铁，空橐如罄。\n千载意长，百年俄顷。\n一死一生，遇此衰境。\n姜盐鬻茶，油葱浇饼。\n唤公不应，老泪泉迸。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":18415,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"祭静江帅曾吏部","author":"释善珍","text":"公掾富沙，来就师语。\n少服师训，称公豪举。\n后二十年，麾节煌煌。\n老客辇寺，传公除郎。\n桂联荆渚，朔风孔棘。\n见公起家，大刀长戟。\n冠弹复挂，印刻复销。\n羡公枪榆，如抟扶摇。\n如生马驹，不受控勒。\n如钢百鍊，愈不改色。\n士不患才，患不身脩。\n脩身既才，奚訾奚尤。\n士挟一能，足以駴世。\n公百其蕴，而不尽试。\n私尝啧啧，叹公不逢。\n公笑谓予，子何褊胸。\n坟寺虚席，乃命扫洒。\n曰子非我，子岂肯下。\n感激怀人，慷慨受知。\n愧无黄金，铸钟子期。\n事与心违，公又仙去。\n精灵地下，知予心事。\n哭西州门，何必羊侯。\n万事宛如，华屋山丘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":18416,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"辞观文赵忠惠坟","author":"释善珍","text":"公归兜率，局面屡变。\n青云交绝，珠履客散。\n白傅草堂，裴公经院。\n僧定未起，樵柯将烂。\n老鹤倦飞，不慕霄汉。\n驽马恋主，非贪豆栈。\n风雨忧愁，常占春半。\n昔倚山岳，今悲露电。\n语犹在耳，事不如愿。\n病忆故乡，一筇易办。\n受恩莫报，迟回眷眷。\n入西州门，泪流被面。\n知音永已，弦断琴爨。\n袖香告辞，用写缱绻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":18417,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古二首 其二","author":"释善能","text":"西山路上有猕猴，啸雨哀风动客愁。\n忽遇此林师子子，万般伎俩一时休。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":18418,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古二首 其一","author":"释善能","text":"古殿无人到者稀，蒲团端坐有谁知。\n不因院主通消息，争得寒光万里辉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":18419,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈","author":"释善能","text":"万古长空，一朝风月。\n不可以一朝风月昧却万古长空，不可以万古长空不明一朝风月。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":18420,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈","author":"释善资","text":"诸方五日一参，寿宁日日升座。\n莫怪重说偈言，过在西来达磨。\n上士处处逢渠，后学时时蹉过。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":18421,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送临安南荡崇觉空禅师偈","author":"释善清","text":"十年聚首龙峰寺，一悟真空万境閒。\n此去随缘且高隐，莫将名字落人间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":18422,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"读法界观","author":"释善清","text":"多中即一一中多，浪里全提水是波。\n波水灭时多一尽，日轮当午见星河。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":18423,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂二首 其二","author":"释善清","text":"八万四千非一一，七金山内海滔滔。\n妙高峰顶平如掌，谁把长竿钓巨鳌。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":18424,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂二首 其一","author":"释善清","text":"铜砂锣里油清净，照见尘中旧主人。\n寄语禅人猛参取，莫教孤负此生身。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":18425,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈五首 其二","author":"释善清","text":"掩息茅堂过六冬，心忘境寂万缘空。\n不知幻业从何起，依旧令教振祖风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":18426,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈五首 其一","author":"释善清","text":"不出三门九十日，大都只要此心休。\n此心休了全无事，天下名山任意游。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":18427,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈五首 其五","author":"释善清","text":"云从龙，风从虎，冬至寒食一百五。\n自古相传直至今，南泉不打盐官鼓。\n参玄人，休莽卤，甜者甜兮苦者苦。\n直截毗卢向上关，莫教错却来时路。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":18428,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈五首 其四","author":"释善清","text":"日入酉，梦幻空花能几久。\n百岁光阴二分过，茫茫无限途中走。\n告禅人，早回首，莫待春风动杨柳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":18429,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈五首 其三","author":"释善清","text":"万仞嵯峨鸟道难，剑轮挥处骨毛寒。\n泥牛昨夜归沧海，吸得西江水尽乾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":18430,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈","author":"释善清","text":"随随随，昔昔昔，随随随后无人识。\n夜来明月上高峰，元来祇是这个贼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":18431,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"洛下别同志","author":"释善勤","text":"岁暮远交朋，携筇背洛城。\n往来兴废地，今古别离情。\n叠翠嵩峰色，泻寒伊水声。\n他年再相会，却讶白髭生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":18432,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋郊晚望","author":"释善勤","text":"华郭外登临，凝眸秋色深。\n树凋分岳面，云破露天心。\n断雁当空续，残阳隔陇沉。\n盘桓伤急景，回首动微吟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":18433,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"辞显禅师题壁","author":"释善暹","text":"不是无心继祖灯，道惭未厕岭南能。\n三更月下离岩窦，眷眷无言恋碧层。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":18434,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"白莲花 其一","author":"释惠日","text":"神物何由测，芬陀陆地兴。\n素芳呈玉雪，梵刹肇丘陵。\n换额从偏霸，悬碑自老僧。\n慇勤劝来者，期使续千灯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":18435,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"白莲花 其二","author":"释惠日","text":"白羽芬葩陆地莲，可曾摇曳水中天。\n肯于素艳分新洁，不与红酣斗碧鲜。\n玉井无因期摘实，金园有兆必开先。\n应知瑞与优昙并，一朵腾芳万古传。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":18436,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏菖蒲","author":"释惠明","text":"根下尘泥一点无，性便泉石爱清孤。\n当时不惹湘江恨，叶叶如何有泪珠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":18437,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"手影戏","author":"释惠明","text":"三尺生绡作戏台，全凭十指逞诙谐。\n有时明月灯窗下，一笑还从掌握来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":18438,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题大慈坞祖塔院","author":"释惠觉","text":"谷口两三家，平田一望赊。\n春深多遇雨，夜静独鸣蛙。\n云暗未通月，林香始辨花。\n谁惊孤枕晓，涛白捲江沙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":18439,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"释惠觉","text":"澜深鱼自跃，风暖客还来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":18440,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送王山人归隐","author":"释惠涣","text":"山人惟委命，岂恋世尘间。\n干禄不得志，移家住远山。\n醉眠溪石静，吟倚草堂閒。\n到想无馀事，林僧日往还。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":18441,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郊行","author":"释惠高","text":"野田分路入谁家，绿树鸣莺坎闹蛙。\n过午歇凉人睡足，村村水满稻吹花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":18442,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书林逸人壁","author":"释惠崇","text":"诗语动惊众，谁知慕隐沦。\n水烟常似暝，林雪乍如春。\n薄酒懒邀客，好书愁借人。\n有时行药去，忘却戴纱巾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":18443,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"池上鹭分赋得明字","author":"释惠崇","text":"雨绝方塘溢，迟徊不复惊。\n曝翎沙日暖，引步岛风清。\n照水千寻迥，栖烟一点明。\n主人池上凤，见尔忆蓬瀛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":18444,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"访杨云卿淮上别墅","author":"释惠崇","text":"地近得频到，相携向野亭。\n河分冈势断，春入烧痕青。\n望久人收钓，吟馀鹤振翎。\n不愁归路晚，明月上前汀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":18445,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送安学士守睦州","author":"释惠崇","text":"白浪满遥程，公衙□□声。\n海帆通夜市，山雨遍春耕。\n古意随琴远，离愁对酒轻。\n三吴窥列宿，知傍隼旟明。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":18446,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"晚夏夜简程至","author":"释惠崇","text":"中夕坐清簟，繁星时复流。\n扇声微变暑，井气忽生秋。\n为客方经楚，思乡欲上楼。\n云山殊未返，相顾两悠悠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":18447,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"塞上赠王太尉","author":"释惠崇","text":"飞将是嫖姚，行营已近辽。\n河冰坚度马，塞雪密藏雕。\n败虏残旗在，全军列帐遥。\n传呼更号令，今夜取天骄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":18448,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题石桥","author":"释惠崇","text":"千寻亘绝险，危步想仙翁。\n日上霞纹断，春生雪溜空。\n虹形离碧水，轮势入青穹。\n人世何由及，唯应天汉通。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":18449,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠文兆","author":"释惠崇","text":"偶依京寺住，谁复得相寻。\n独鹤窥朝讲，邻僧听夜琴。\n注瓶沙井远，鸣磬雪房深。\n久与松萝别，空悬王屋心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":18450,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠吴黔山人","author":"释惠崇","text":"三年不下岳，衣屦古苔侵。\n石涧探幽步，风泉得句心。\n黄猿知日暝，青树觉春深。\n又向南峰住，时时许我寻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":18451,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"古塞曲","author":"释惠崇","text":"边烽久不息，戍鼓何鼟鼟。\n五月无青草，滂沱流断冰。\n胡儿昧形胜，汉骑恣凭陵。\n出号朔风起，受降沙垒崩。\n楼烦已纳款，天意□威棱。\n归佩封侯印，喧然世所称。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":18452,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"中夜起","author":"释惠崇","text":"初月不到晓，夜色何冥冥。\n独立秋江上，风波卷寒星。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":18453,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"拟古","author":"释惠崇","text":"幽禽迎曙响，佳木含春荣。\n独有绮窗妇，耿耿万里情。\n尘色皓鸳幌，日华明风筝。\n高盖久不返，中宵自怀贞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":18454,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"剡中秋怀昼师","author":"释惠崇","text":"秋生剡江濆，清气日泱漭。\n云归树欲无，潮落山疑长。\n偶坐还独谣，故人在遐想。\n夕景孤屿明，暗虫四邻响。\n神会如目存，安知途路广。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":18455,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其七十五","author":"释惠崇","text":"河来天上阔，云度月边轻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":18456,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其六十三","author":"释惠崇","text":"松风传夕磬，溪雾拥春灯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":18457,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二十九","author":"释惠崇","text":"繁霜衣上积，残月马前低。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":18458,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其七十二","author":"释惠崇","text":"月露疏寒析，云涛闪画旗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":18459,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其三十九","author":"释惠崇","text":"寒禽栖古柳，破月入微云。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":18460,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二十六","author":"释惠崇","text":"夜阑潮动舸，秋迥月临城。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":18461,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其九十七","author":"释惠崇","text":"渡河风动旆，巡部雨沾车。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":18462,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其八十六","author":"释惠崇","text":"拂石云离帚，尝茶月入铛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":18463,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其七十六","author":"释惠崇","text":"海人来相鹤，山狖下听琴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":18464,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其八十二","author":"释惠崇","text":"井含春气碧，楼转夕阴清。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":18465,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其五十","author":"释惠崇","text":"离碛雁冲雪，渡河人上冰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":18466,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其十","author":"释惠崇","text":"久别年颜改，相逢夜话长。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":18467,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其十五","author":"释惠崇","text":"探骑通番垒，降兵逐汉旗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":18468,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其五十二","author":"释惠崇","text":"关河双鬓白，风雪一灯青。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":18469,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其六十五","author":"释惠崇","text":"坐石云生袖，添泉月入瓶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":18470,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其四十六","author":"释惠崇","text":"境闲僧渡水，云尽鹤盘空。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":18471,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二十五","author":"释惠崇","text":"霜多秦木迥，云尽汉山孤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":18472,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其四十八","author":"释惠崇","text":"禽寒时动竹，露重忽翻荷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":18473,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}}]